# Agents

This is a Beach app. The framework is `github.com/ThirdCoastInteractive/Beach`.

**Do not invent a parallel of anything already in the framework.** Map the task to a package, then call it. Framework skills live in the Beach module under `skills/` (`beach`, `beach-ui`, `beach-a11y`, `beach-test`).

## Laws

- Handlers are `PageFunc`, `ActionFunc`, `StreamFunc`, `SocketFunc`. `app.Raw` is the escape hatch.
- UI is `pkg/ui/driftwood`. `ui.Icon`, not raw `<i>`. No HTML primitives the kit already owns.
- SQL lives in sqlc queries. Transactions are `pg.InTx`.
- Datastar attributes come from `pkg/datastar`. Raw `data-*` fails `beach-vet`.
- Names a person hears come from the i18n catalog. Follow `beach-a11y` when touching UI.

## Verify

`make gen` after `.templ` / CSS / sqlc / ECS schema. Then `make vet` and `make test`. Browser-check UI: no console errors, the change is visible, no 404s.
